message: "Cite the repository as 'one-field' and the relevant motivation papers listed in README.md."
title: "one-field: the Standard Model constant table from the E_8(1) > G_2(1) x F_4(1) interference web"
abstract: "Executable derivation of the Standard Model constant table, gravity, and the dark sector from a recursive interference web whose dictionary and Planck-scale channel coupling are generated by interference/wiring.py. The open items are the mixing-sector operator lift, the gravity normalisation mechanism, and confined-phase winding protection."
authors:
